  m_text: "The grid to the left matches the number and orientation of the field grid.
    \n\nClick the small grid to make a record of what you have found where in the
    field. Each time you press will change the color to indicate:\n\n1. An unexcavated
    plot of land\n2. An obstacle stopping you from digging.\n3. A dug unit where
    you found nothing.\n4. A unit where you found a feature.\n\nHINT: When you are
    looking at the field toggle the SHOW COORDINATES button in the top left to reveal
    the same coordinate numbers as this minimap."
